### Bug: a crew member is never freed when their job is completed
`src/crew.js:6`: once `crew.jobId` is set, `tick` only ever adds hours. `Board.complete()` (`src/board.js:5`) removes the job, but nothing clears `crew.jobId`. So the crew member stays "busy" on a job that no longer exists. They never take new work and keep building up `hoursWorked`, which goes straight into `payroll.wages()`.

